{#- Speak page: the four formats you can host, each a pastel card with its length big and a bar drawn against a 90-minute line. No blank lines: Markdown includes this -#}
<ul class="picks">
  <li class="pick pick-lightning" data-reveal>
    <span class="pick-name"><i class="ph ph-lightning" aria-hidden="true"></i>Lightning talk</span>
    <span class="pick-time"><b>5</b> min</span>
    <span class="pick-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--w:5"></i></span>
    <p class="pick-good">One idea, slides optional. The easiest way onto the stage.</p>
    <p class="pick-hint"><strong>Propose:</strong> a tool you like, a trick you learned or a bug that bit you.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="pick pick-talk" data-reveal>
    <span class="pick-name"><i class="ph ph-presentation-chart" aria-hidden="true"></i>Talk</span>
    <span class="pick-time"><b>20 to 30</b> min</span>
    <span class="pick-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--w:30"></i></span>
    <p class="pick-good">Something you built, broke or learned, with time for questions.</p>
    <p class="pick-hint"><strong>Propose:</strong> a story with a clear takeaway, and say what the room should know beforehand.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="pick pick-workshop" data-reveal>
    <span class="pick-name"><i class="ph ph-laptop" aria-hidden="true"></i>Workshop</span>
    <span class="pick-time"><b>60 to 90</b> min</span>
    <span class="pick-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--w:90"></i></span>
    <p class="pick-good">Laptops open, code along, leave with something working.</p>
    <p class="pick-hint"><strong>Propose:</strong> what people will build, what to install first and how long it needs.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="pick pick-bof" data-reveal>
    <span class="pick-name"><i class="ph ph-chats-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>Birds of a Feather</span>
    <span class="pick-time"><b>Open</b> ended</span>
    <span class="pick-bar pick-bar-open" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--w:60"></i></span>
    <p class="pick-good">A small circle around one topic, where everyone gets a turn to talk.</p>
    <p class="pick-hint"><strong>Propose:</strong> the question you want to explore and who would enjoy the conversation.</p>
  </li>
</ul>
